Safety Considerations

Like any large convention, wisdom is important.

A family or church group should:

* Stay together.
* Respect conference rules.
* Avoid illegal activities.
* Never attempt unauthorized access to systems.
* Ask questions respectfully.
* Focus on educational sessions.
* Keep normal travel safety practices.

The conference is best approached as an educational experience.

