⸻

Final Thoughts

Technology will continue shaping the future.

Rather than fearing it or ignoring it, Christians can engage with it wisely, ethically, and faithfully.

DEF CON offers a unique opportunity to learn from experts, gain practical skills, and discover ways to protect families, churches, ministries, and communities.

By approaching the conference with humility, integrity, and a servant’s heart, our family and youth group can grow not only in technical knowledge but also in our ability to care for others in an increasingly digital world.

The goal is not to create hackers.

The goal is to cultivate wise, ethical, and capable servants who use their knowledge to glorify God by protecting and helping others.